From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Lusoris Authors <lusoris@example.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sched/ext: ensure default scx switchable scheduler baseline

Ensure that SCHED_CLASS_EXT allows hot runtime switching without
requiring manual debugfs overrides.

Signed-off-by: The Lusoris Authors <lusoris@example.com>
---
 kernel/sched/ext.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/kernel/sched/ext.c b/kernel/sched/ext.c
index e111111..e222222 100644
--- a/kernel/sched/ext.c
+++ b/kernel/sched/ext.c
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
 /*
  * sched_ext: BPF extensible CPU scheduler
  */
